\f1\i0 \'92 Eloise took a breath. She so rarely lost her cool, but Alexander\'85 Alexander was always so draining. A little calmer, she continued, \'91As per the contract, I am expecting and will receive, a convincing enough service to keep Al\'97the candidate\'97immersed until I am ready to reassign him. Or her.\'92 
