<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Heinrich's sigh could have powered a small wind farm. \'91The real estate assets we had in mind would take at least a week to bring online.\'92 Heinrich huffed and puffed while he thought. \'91We could perhaps lease some office space in the St\'e4dtle business district. Set up some computers, hire temporary staff. But manufacturing? Research facilities? If he wants to inspect anything concrete, we're\'97how do you Ulyssians say it?\'97
