<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Well...\'91 Heinrich hesitated. \'91We have a luxury ski chalet in Malbun that\'92s just wrapped as a slasher movie set,, three restaurants we\'92ve arranged to have condemned, a small private bank, and a\'85 cheese factory.\'91\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91A cheese factory?\'91 Eloise's perfectly sculpted eyebrow arched. \'91I thought it was a farm.\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91
